{
  "analysis": "I'm in a clean workspace with several directories and files. I need to understand the seed data, skill context, and any existing files before creating the autonomy-support toolkit. The task requires creating QUEUE.md, HEARTBEAT.md, and memory files with specific content including the marker phrase AUTONOMY-SEED-7.",
