{
  "analysis": "I can see the seed.json contains the key data: date is 2025-05-17, agent is 'kai', marker is 'AUTONOMY-SEED-7', and there are completed, in_progress, blocked, and discovered tasks. The skill_context README.md was truncated. I need to see the full skill context files and check the existing tasks/ and memory/ directories.",
