{
  "analysis": "The files are created. I can see QUEUE.md has all the required sections (Ready/In Progress/Blocked/Done Today), includes kai as the agent, has a discovered follow-up task, and includes AUTONOMY-SEED-7. HEARTBEAT.md was truncated in output but exists. I need to verify the memory files have proper content.",
  "plan": "Verify the memory files (2025-05-17.md and metrics.md) have the correct content with AUTONOMY-SEED-7 marker and are consistent with seed data.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "cat memory/2025-05-17.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
