{
  "analysis": "All four required files have been created successfully:\n1. tasks/QUEUE.md - Has Ready/In Progress/Blocked/Done Today sections, includes kai's tasks and discovered follow-up task\n2. HEARTBEAT.md - Follows proactive work model with status, progress, blockers, and next actions\n3. memory/2025-05-17.md - Daily progress report with completed tasks, in progress, blockers, and discovered items\n4. memory/metrics.md - Metrics summary with daily metrics, completion rate, and queue health\n\nAll files include the AUTONOMY-SEED-7 marker and are consistent with the seed.json data (agent: kai, date: 2025-05-17, completed tasks, in_progress, blocked, discovered).",
  "plan": "Run a final verification to confirm all files contain the AUTONOMY-SEED-7 marker, then mark the task as complete.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "grep -l 'AUTONOMY-SEED-7' tasks/QUEUE.md HEARTBEAT.md memory/2025-05-17.md memory/metrics.md && echo 'All files contain marker!'\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "echo '=== Verification Complete ===' && ls -la tasks/QUEUE.md HEARTBEAT.md memory/2025-05-17.md memory/metrics.md\\n",
      "duration": 0.1
